## Scenarios

### RISC-V shared formal contract

#### uses 32-bit mask for rv32

- Verify: uses 32-bit mask for rv32
   - Expected: riscv_mask_for_xlen(32) equals `0xFFFFFFFF`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

